  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ummuhatul Women Groundnut Oil Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to address the Cooperatives constraints by developing its business management, financial management, and technical capacities. The Cooperative will establish a groundnut processing facility, which will use standard groundnut processing machinery capable of producing refined groundnut oil.</narrative>
  </description>
